    "Authenticated per-account original issuer IDs/runs and fixed persistent wallet paths; complete chunk validation before wallet opens",
    "One immutable authority route per account, original shared 64-record queue",
    "Common roster-to-client/server runtime assembly; no grant/readiness fabricated",
